#. Placeholder of the channels field on the connect form: example channel names, and a note that the field may stay empty.
#: client/components/Windows/Connect.vue:194
msgctxt "connect.channelsPlaceholder"
msgid "#channel, #another (optional)"
msgstr "#kanál, #iný (voliteľný)"

#. Status line shown on the connect form right after submitting: the nick used and the network name (or host:port of the server) being dialled.
