msgstr "Nastavenia kart"

#. Label of the Settings modal's General tab (tab strip); switching tabs navigates to the General settings pane.
#: client/components/Settings/Navigation.vue
#: client/components/Settings/SettingTabItem.vue
msgctxt "settings.tabs.general"
